get_categories (lib/WWW/Picnic.pm ~514, GET my_store) returns the raw request hashref instead of a typed WWW::Picnic::Result::* object, breaking the house pattern that every endpoint with a shape wraps its response. Add WWW::Picnic::Result::Category (or similar), wire it into WWW::Picnic.pm (use + return), list it in t/load.t, add a sample generator to t/lib/WWW/Picnic/MockUA.pm, and cover it in t/offline.t. CLI 'picnic categories' consumes this.

